  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "speaker_id": null,
    "text": "The two trade slow gestures and half-sentences, each trying to bridge what the other means, the islets hanging between them like a half-drawn map.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:communicate", "attempt:communicate"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "speaker_id": null,
    "text": "Ash pauses, then adds a quiet remark about the islets, watching Wren’s face for a spark of recognition.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["reaction:2"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "narration",
    "speaker_id": null,
    "text": "Wren’s hand hovers above the table, then falls flat — a slow breath, as the conversation settles into shared silence.",
